  "verdict": "The residual bound \u2211\u03c1 \u03ba_B \u2264 (H\u22121\u22122/p\u00b2)/4 is equivalent to Hypothesis H (ray\u2264H). It HOLDS at all certified primes p=3,5,7 (equality at 3,5; strict at 7). No counterexample found. A general proof for all p\u22655 remains OPEN \u2014 same difficulty as H. Bi-tight still open; lim \u03b1_n OPEN.",
